﻿# CodeSentinel X (Universal Security Scanner)

CodeSentinel X is an enterprise-grade, installable codebase security scanner focused on multi-language secure code analysis.

Tagline: **Scan every line. Quantify every risk.**

## What This Repository Includes

### Core Scanner
- Recursive code scanning for multi-language repositories.
- Built-in OWASP-aligned detection rules.
- Extended vulnerability coverage through optional external analyzers:
  - Semgrep (broad SAST rules)
  - Trivy (dependency, misconfiguration, secret scanning)
  - Gitleaks (enterprise secret detection)
  - CodeQL (when enabled)
- Dependency vulnerability checks.
- Risk score and executive summary generation.
- Exports: JSON, HTML, PDF, SARIF.
- Distinct report sections:
  - Existing security measures (implemented controls)
  - Vulnerability findings
  - Auto-fix recommendations

### Plugin SDK + Built-In Language Plugins
- SDK interfaces for language-specific analyzers.
- Built-in plugins:
  - Python
  - JavaScript/TypeScript
  - Go

### Enterprise Platform Skeleton
- Microservice stubs for orchestrator, findings, reports, identity, integrations, and audit.
- Docker Compose enterprise stack.
- Helm chart for Kubernetes deployment.
- CI templates for GitHub/GitLab policy-gated scans.
- REST + GraphQL contracts.
- React dashboard mock UI.

